<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines December inflation at 5.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Philippines December inflation at 5.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Annualised consumer inflation in the Philippines in December was 5.1 percent compared to 4.5 percent in November, the National Statistics Office said on Monday.  </p>
<p>It also said the 1996 full-year inflation rose to 8.4 percent from 8.1 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES		 Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)  0.8	  -0.2	  0.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    5.1	   4.5	 11.0</p>
<p>    Index (base 100 = 1988)     231.4	 229.6	220.1</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
